iddle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and March to April and May to June each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them. In 2025, July to August came in at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, January to February sits at 40% and June to July at 58%. Grid 29046 had its driest year in 2001 at 57%.</p>"}
